{
  "kanji": "量",
  "completeCard": "---\nkanji: 量\ntitle: quantity; amount\njlpt: 2\ntags: [jlpt-n2, grade-4, structure-unclassified]\nstrokes: 12\nradical: 里\nradicalNumber: 166\nonyomi: [リョウ]\nkunyomi: [はか.る]\ndistractors: [童, 黒, 普]\n---\n\n# 量 — quantity; amount\n\n**Strokes:** 12 · **Key (radical):** 里 (no. 166) · **JLPT:** N2 (community list)\n\n## Meaning and origin\n\n量 concerns quantity, amount or measurement. 量 is the noun りょう, while 量る is a verb for measuring or weighing.\n\n**Modern-shape mnemonic, not etymology:** Picture the upper 日-like block above a measuring container shaped like 里. This is a visual mnemonic, not a claim about the character's historical formation.\n\nThe canonical radical is 里, no. 166, in the lower part.\n\n## Readings\n\n| Reading | Type | Typical words |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| リョウ | on | [量](../words/量.md) りょう - quantity; amount; [重量](../words/重量.md) じゅうりょう - weight; [測量](../words/測量.md) そくりょう - surveying |\n| はか.る | kun | [量る](../words/計る.md) はかる - measure; weigh |\n\n## Common words\n\n- [分量](../words/分量.md) ぶんりょう - amount; quantity\n- [量](../words/量.md) りょう - quantity; amount\n- [重量](../words/重量.md) じゅうりょう - weight\n- [測量](../words/測量.md) そくりょう - surveying; measurement\n- [量る](../words/計る.md) はかる - measure; weigh\n\n## Notes\n\n- The noun 量 りょう and transitive godan verb 量る はかる are distinct complete forms.\n- The inspected はかる family also contains 計る and 測る. A shared entry supports recognized spellings, not an unrestricted rule that every sentence uses each spelling equally naturally.\n\nMetadata: [KANJIDIC2](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/KANJIDIC_Project), 2026-10-21 snapshot. Word pairs: [JMdict](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/JMdict-EDICT_Dictionary_Project), entries 1336900, 1504430, 1554640, 1600650.\n",
